<mjml><mj-head><!-- VISIBILITY_STYLES --><mj-style>
      /* Desktop-first : les clients qui ne supportent pas @media
         (Outlook Web, Nouveau Outlook) gardent le comportement desktop. */
      .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
        display: block;
        width: auto;
        max-height: none;
        overflow: visible;
        line-height: inherit;
      }
      .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
        display: none;
        width: 0;
        max-height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        line-height: 0;
      }
      /* Mobile : afficher mobile-only, masquer desktop-only */
      @media only screen and (max-width:599px) {
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
      }
      /* Desktop explicit (pour spécificité) */
      @media only screen and (min-width:600px) {
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      }
      /* Fallback : vrais appareils mobiles (Outlook mobile peut avoir un viewport &gt;600px) */
      @media only screen and (max-device-width:599px) {
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      }
    </mj-style><!--[if mso | IE]>
      <style type="text/css">
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
        table.desktop-only, table.desktop-only-outlook, table[class*="desktop-only"],
        tr.desktop-only, tr.desktop-only-outlook, tr[class*="desktop-only"],
        td.desktop-only, td.desktop-only-outlook, td[class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: table !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        table.mobile-only, table.mobile-only-outlook, table[class*="mobile-only"],
        tr.mobile-only, tr.mobile-only-outlook, tr[class*="mobile-only"],
        td.mobile-only, td.mobile-only-outlook, td[class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      </style>
    <![endif]--><mj-attributes><mj-all padding="0">
            </mj-all></mj-attributes><mj-font name="Cormorant Garamond" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,500&display=swap"></mj-font><mj-style>@media only screen and (max-width:479px){.h2 div{font-size:31px!important;line-height:35px!important;}.card > table > tbody > tr > td{padding-left:22px!important;padding-right:22px!important;}.rows td{display:block!important;width:100%!important;text-align:left!important;}.rows td.c1{border-bottom:0!important;padding-bottom:0!important;}.rows td.c2{padding-top:2px!important;}}</mj-style><mj-preview>Quatre rendez-vous de fête, et une chambre pour prolonger la soirée.</mj-preview></mj-head><mj-body background-color="#1C2B4A" width="600px"><mj-section padding="0"><mj-column><mj-image css-class="tf-logo" src="https://api.trigger-flow.com/images/email-library/temps-forts/fetes-logo-blanc.png" alt="{{facility_name}}" align="center" width="150px" padding="34px 20px 22px 20px"></mj-image></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0 20px 8px 20px"><mj-column css-class="card" background-color="#FFFFFF" border="3px double #1C2B4A" padding="34px 38px"><mj-text align="center" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="13px" letter-spacing="3px" font-weight="bold" color="#C0563F" padding="0"><p style="margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;">Les tables de fête</p></mj-text><mj-text css-class="h2" align="center" font-family="'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif" font-size="38px" line-height="42px" font-weight="600" color="#1C2B4A" padding="12px 0 8px 0"><div>Noël et Nouvel An, votre table vous attend</div></mj-text><mj-text align="center" font-family="'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif" font-size="19px" line-height="26px" font-style="italic" color="#1F2430" padding="0 0 12px 0"><p style="margin:0;">Quatre rendez-vous de fête, et une chambre pour prolonger la soirée.</p></mj-text><mj-table css-class="rows" padding="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="c1" valign="top" style="border-bottom:1px dotted #1C2B4A;padding:16px 0 14px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;color:#1C2B4A;"><div style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:bold;color:#C0563F;">[[Date|24 décembre]]</div><div style="font-size:26px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;padding-top:4px;">Le réveillon de Noël</div><div style="font-size:18px;line-height:24px;font-style:italic;color:#1F2430;padding-top:2px;">Un menu de fête, servi à table.</div></td><td class="c2" valign="bottom" align="right" width="110" style="border-bottom:1px dotted #1C2B4A;padding:16px 0 14px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;color:#1C2B4A;white-space:nowrap;">[[Prix|89 €]]</td></tr><tr><td class="c1" valign="top" style="border-bottom:1px dotted #1C2B4A;padding:16px 0 14px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;color:#1C2B4A;"><div style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:bold;color:#C0563F;">[[Date|25 décembre]]</div><div style="font-size:26px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;padding-top:4px;">Le déjeuner de Noël</div><div style="font-size:18px;line-height:24px;font-style:italic;color:#1F2430;padding-top:2px;">Un déjeuner en famille, sans rien préparer.</div></td><td class="c2" valign="bottom" align="right" width="110" style="border-bottom:1px dotted #1C2B4A;padding:16px 0 14px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;color:#1C2B4A;white-space:nowrap;">[[Prix|65 €]]</td></tr><tr><td class="c1" valign="top" style="border-bottom:1px dotted #1C2B4A;padding:16px 0 14px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;color:#1C2B4A;"><div style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:bold;color:#C0563F;">[[Date|31 décembre]]</div><div style="font-size:26px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;padding-top:4px;">La Saint-Sylvestre</div><div style="font-size:18px;line-height:24px;font-style:italic;color:#1F2430;padding-top:2px;">Le grand dîner de l'année, jusqu'au dernier verre.</div></td><td class="c2" valign="bottom" align="right" width="110" style="border-bottom:1px dotted #1C2B4A;padding:16px 0 14px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;color:#1C2B4A;white-space:nowrap;">[[Prix|119 €]]</td></tr><tr><td class="c1" valign="top" style="border-bottom:1px dotted #1C2B4A;padding:16px 0 14px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;color:#1C2B4A;"><div style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:bold;color:#C0563F;">[[Date|1er janvier]]</div><div style="font-size:26px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;padding-top:4px;">Le brunch du Nouvel An</div><div style="font-size:18px;line-height:24px;font-style:italic;color:#1F2430;padding-top:2px;">Bien commencer l'année, sans se presser.</div></td><td class="c2" valign="bottom" align="right" width="110" style="border-bottom:1px dotted #1C2B4A;padding:16px 0 14px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;color:#1C2B4A;white-space:nowrap;">[[Prix|45 €]]</td></tr></mj-table><mj-text align="center" font-family="'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif" font-size="19px" line-height="26px" color="#1F2430" padding="24px 0 6px 0"><p style="margin:0;">Pour prolonger la soirée : une chambre à partir de [[Prix de la chambre|140 €]].</p></mj-text><mj-text align="center" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="14px" line-height="21px" font-weight="bold" color="#B3261E" padding="6px 0 22px 0"><p style="margin:0;">Réservez votre table pour le [[Jour du réveillon|24]] ou le [[Jour de la Saint-Sylvestre|31]].</p></mj-text><mj-button href="[[Lien de réservation du restaurant|{{booking_page_url}}]]" align="center" background-color="#C0563F" color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="2px" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" inner-padding="16px 34px" padding="0">Réserver ma table</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="12px" line-height="19px" color="#B9C3D9" padding="26px 36px 34px 36px"><p style="margin:0;">{{facility_name}}, {{facility_address}}, {{facility_zip_code}} {{facility_city}}<br/>Vous recevez ce message parce que vous avez déjà échangé avec nous. <a href="{{unsubscribe_link}}" style="color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:underline;">Se désinscrire</a></p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section></mj-body></mjml>